{"4008930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HOLY Intentions", "steam_appid": 4008930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>HOLY Intentions</strong></i> is a <strong>high-octane</strong> <strong>old school FPS</strong> that fuses together the relentless combat of <i>Doom Eternal</i> and <i>Ultrakill</i> with dark fantasy action inspired by titles like <i>Elden Ring</i> and <i>Bloodborne</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>Crusader</strong>, destined to <strong>restore divine justice</strong> to a world on the brink of chaos. <strong>Tear apart</strong> your enemies with <strong>divine weapons</strong>, brutal <strong>holy powers</strong>, and the <strong>souls</strong> of their leaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more your enemies fear you, <strong>the stronger you become</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/1fad7f8a8036aa0138d3dfd4626dab55.poster.avif?t=1788246210\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/1fad7f8a8036aa0138d3dfd4626dab55.webm?t=1788246210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/1fad7f8a8036aa0138d3dfd4626dab55.mp4?t=1788246210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Majestic yet Brutal Combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with unrestricted freedom by <strong>Dashing</strong>, <strong>Soaring</strong> above enemies, and <strong>Surfing on Lightning</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a <strong>Dragon</strong> that transforms into a <strong>Greatsword</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use over 40 <strong>devastating holy powers</strong>, like turning enemy blood into guillotines or calling down Comets from divine trebuchets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resurrect</strong> slain bosses as <strong>weapons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Negate</strong> and <strong>Shatter</strong> enemy attacks to <strong>regain health</strong> and continue fighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore varied dark fantasy realms packed with dangers and mysteries to <strong>upgrade</strong> your <strong>weapons</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Punish the Wicked</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the shadows, the <strong>Order of Majistos</strong> secretly controls the entire world. Now, they wish to go even further - to usurp the throne of <strong>God</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear your way through vast <strong>mystical levels</strong> to hunt down and <strong>execute</strong> those who <strong>ruined the world</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/04e3320449e1a87b453b00f6209c62de.poster.avif?t=1788246210\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/04e3320449e1a87b453b00f6209c62de.webm?t=1788246210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/04e3320449e1a87b453b00f6209c62de.mp4?t=1788246210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>HOLY Intentions</strong></i> is a <strong>high-octane</strong> <strong>old school FPS</strong> that fuses together the relentless combat of <i>Doom Eternal</i> and <i>Ultrakill</i> with dark fantasy action inspired by titles like <i>Elden Ring</i> and <i>Bloodborne</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>Crusader</strong>, destined to <strong>restore divine justice</strong> to a world on the brink of chaos. <strong>Tear apart</strong> your enemies with <strong>divine weapons</strong>, brutal <strong>holy powers</strong>, and the <strong>souls</strong> of their leaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more your enemies fear you, <strong>the stronger you become</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/1fad7f8a8036aa0138d3dfd4626dab55.poster.avif?t=1788246210\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/1fad7f8a8036aa0138d3dfd4626dab55.webm?t=1788246210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/1fad7f8a8036aa0138d3dfd4626dab55.mp4?t=1788246210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Majestic yet Brutal Combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with unrestricted freedom by <strong>Dashing</strong>, <strong>Soaring</strong> above enemies, and <strong>Surfing on Lightning</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a <strong>Dragon</strong> that transforms into a <strong>Greatsword</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use over 40 <strong>devastating holy powers</strong>, like turning enemy blood into guillotines or calling down Comets from divine trebuchets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resurrect</strong> slain bosses as <strong>weapons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Negate</strong> and <strong>Shatter</strong> enemy attacks to <strong>regain health</strong> and continue fighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore varied dark fantasy realms packed with dangers and mysteries to <strong>upgrade</strong> your <strong>weapons</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Punish the Wicked</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the shadows, the <strong>Order of Majistos</strong> secretly controls the entire world. Now, they wish to go even further - to usurp the throne of <strong>God</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear your way through vast <strong>mystical levels</strong> to hunt down and <strong>execute</strong> those who <strong>ruined the world</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/04e3320449e1a87b453b00f6209c62de.poster.avif?t=1788246210\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/04e3320449e1a87b453b00f6209c62de.webm?t=1788246210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/04e3320449e1a87b453b00f6209c62de.mp4?t=1788246210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "HOLY Intentions is a fast-paced FPS set on a divine scale. You are the Crusader, chosen to punish the wicked. Armed with a Dragon and devastating holy powers, tear apart an evil cult that controls the entire world.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Norwegian, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/b5454209aab7add015197290a9e9012ae8789788/header.jpg?t=1788246210", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co